> order. For examply giant mimics are above rock / ice trolls, and large
> mimics are above air elements! Also, fire/soldier ants are fairly low,
> but they can be quite hard to hit, and pretty difficult. Is this just
> ordered by the monster 'level' I take it?

There is an internal "difficulty level" counter that is partly used for
sorting the endgame list of monsters.  After sorting by this list the
monsters are simply listed by these levels and the original in-game
order of the monster list.

A while back I generated a list of monsters sorted by difficulty level
then by experience for the latest version of the game, so you can get an
idea of how the internal numbers pan out.  It's on the NetHack wiki at
http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Monsters_%28by_difficulty%29

